  "img": "icons/magic/fire/projectile-meteor-salvo-heavy-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you gain this ability, you can coat your weapon in a destructive layer of fire. When you hit with a melee weapon attack, you can expend a Foxfire Point to deal an extra 1d8 fire damage.</p>\n<p>At 10th level, you can cause your flames to remain. When you use this feature, instead of igniting one attack, you can ignite all melee weapons you are wielding for 1 minute. For the duration, their melee weapon attacks now deal an extra 1d8 fire damage.</p>",
